WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
Worked on the series:
Lily, Tiramisu, Zinger, Pineapple, Host, Biryulka

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
How did I become

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
queen

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:03.920
FANSUB GROUP AZALIA PRESENTS

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:06.420
All characters are fictitious

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:08.990
and the events shown are fiction.

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:10.990
Episode 5

00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:13.730
Every person has their own weakness.

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:21.740
Even Superman when encountering kryptonite

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:25.910
becomes just a weirdo
who wears underpants over his pants.

00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:31.380
If Superman is so weak,

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:34.250
imagine what happens to ordinary people.

00:01:46.090 --> 00:01:48.130
I will reveal the truth!

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:52.030
I will accept your will, Your Majesty!

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:54.900
It's not her who needs to be executed!

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:00.640
Your Majesty!

00:02:02.910 --> 00:02:04.340
I beg you.

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:10.150
Will you go against the will of the king?

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:25.100
For the average person, this world is a minefield of weaknesses.

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:27.530
We become each other's weakness

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:29.940
and drag everyone into the underworld.

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:35.180
Even I, the perfect Jang Bong Hwan, have weaknesses.

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:37.380
And this is nothing more than...

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:44.120
I can't stand it when another guy looks cooler than me.

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:47.720
Harm the queen...

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:49.160
Stop!

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:52.460
Especially in the presence of the one I like.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:56.000
I must be the coolest in her eyes.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.370
You could say this is the Achilles heel of

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:02.540
who is perfection itself.

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:20.190
Let me, as a victim of this incident,

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:22.560
shed light on events.

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:26.430
I

00:03:28.530 --> 00:03:30.460
tried to commit suicide.

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:36.600
Do you think there's only one cool guy here?

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:38.810
Don't worry, Cheoljong.

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:40.910
I'm the hero here.

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:47.680
I ask you, do not touch those who are innocent of anything.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.120
Great.

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:54.720
What a ridiculous statement?

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:56.120
The Dowager Queen.

00:03:56.120 --> 00:04:00.230
I'm sorry, but I tried to kill myself.

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:02.230
Leave your false self

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:05.770
I carried this suicide note with me.

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:13.570
I'll still be back today.

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:15.980
I don't care if chaos reigns here.

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:18.950
Why are you doing this?

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:21.650
And why would you kill yourself?

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:24.050
the night before you become queen?

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:27.790
The thing is...

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:30.890
What was your reason?

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:34.830
Well I was depressed
and I wanted to die because...

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:37.800
I'm sure there was a reason.

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:42.100
Your Highness!

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:46.410
Crap!

00:04:48.610 --> 00:04:49.710
Your Majesty!

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:51.140
Soyeon.

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:05.390
Will he take me away now?

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:06.430
Don't you dare.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:08.730
Don't come near. Away!

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:33.050
The Dowager Queen.

00:05:33.050 --> 00:05:36.560
The Queen is telling lies

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:39.490
to save a life
to a less important person than her.

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:41.630
Trust your virtuous heart

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:43.900
forgiving the one
who committed a sin against her,

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:45.530
and show mercy.

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:48.670
So this is how he took it all?

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:15.030
What's so interesting about this?
So many people gathered.

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:19.800
Yours...

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:23.300
Your Majesty.

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:28.880
What happened here?

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:31.780
Fine.

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:34.080
The queen put in so much effort

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:37.050
so be it, I will show mercy.

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:13.150
Episode 5: Achilles' Heel

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:16.960
I haven't seen such a sight for a long time.

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:20.590
I wonder what the queen was thinking when she did that.

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:22.830
Such is the heart of a woman.

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:26.900
But I'm sure the Kims have nothing to do with it.

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:28.330
Yes.

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:31.100
Heading to Sonongjeong Hall?

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:35.280
Today I need something more than prayer.

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:38.680
She's just a weak royal consort

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:41.050
but she is our only arrow.

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:44.420
You need to apply poison to its tip.

00:08:05.370 --> 00:08:06.770
Gods.

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:13.180
Did she try to commit suicide?

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:15.550
What does it mean?

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:17.620
I'll bide my time and wake up at the right moment.

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:20.150
What kind of father am I that I didn’t guess?

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:22.360
I have committed a great sin.

00:08:22.590 --> 00:08:26.160
I have sinned.

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:28.460
It's all my fault.

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:31.100
He should have taken better care of her.

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:33.200
I missed it.

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:35.940
Why did she do this?

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:39.140
You should know, you are with her all the time.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:42.940
She tried to jump into the water several times,

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:46.550
I thought it was because of the shock during the fall.

00:08:46.550 --> 00:08:48.150
Several times?

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:56.120
How did she suffer?

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:58.320
Your Majesty.

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:01.690
Your Majesty.

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:06.300
Well damn, that's enough already.

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:08.700
If you cry, I won’t wake up.

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:15.580
Now is not the time to cry.

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:18.310
He will see us in tears,

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:22.150
will be very upset.

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:23.650
Certainly.

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:25.220
You're right.

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:28.490
At such moments you need to be brave and be close to her.

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:31.290
Should I wake up now?

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:34.060
-Soyeon.
- Damn it.

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:37.660
When your mother gave you life

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:42.340
she lost hers.

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:44.470
Has he started again?

00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:50.210
Your Majesty.

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:53.280
Her Majesty has grown

00:09:53.310 --> 00:09:56.350
not having a chance to see my mother's face.

00:09:56.350 --> 00:09:58.820
I feel so sorry for her.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:02.620
I don't know why she suffered so much

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:05.290
and I only forbade her this and that.

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:08.830
I chased her

00:10:09.430 --> 00:10:12.430
and grumbled all the time.

00:10:12.870 --> 00:10:15.770
It was because of me that she could

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:20.440
jump into the lake.

00:10:20.670 --> 00:10:24.280
How so, Your Majesty.

00:10:25.110 --> 00:10:27.750
Your Majesty!

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:30.280
I give up.

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:33.020
I can't handle this situation.

00:10:33.390 --> 00:10:37.220
Gwanghwamun

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:57.940
My queen.

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:00.850
Please

00:11:00.850 --> 00:11:03.550
take care of yourself.

00:11:04.650 --> 00:11:06.720
Your pathetic father

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:10.490
asks for forgiveness.

00:11:24.770 --> 00:11:26.340
Benin.

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:31.310
Today I will enter the palace.

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:34.210
I will meet the king for the first time.

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.280
So happy?

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:40.090
I'm just curious.

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:42.620
Sometimes he looks like an ugly idiot

00:11:42.620 --> 00:11:45.390
and sometimes as if made of jade.

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:49.560
In my dreams.

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:53.630
Last night he looked exactly like you.

00:11:57.800 --> 00:12:02.410
I believed that I should give up on you
to make you happy.

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:07.150
Before visiting the palace, you were so happy.

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:10.720
However, after visiting the palace she tried to commit suicide.

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.660
Is it really because of this?

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:41.980
She's gone crazy! I've lost the rest of my mind!

00:12:41.980 --> 00:12:43.850
Leave your false self

00:12:43.850 --> 00:12:46.720
She spent several nights with the king.
Are you sure

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:49.460
that he didn't cloud her brain?

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:51.490
Calm down, Your Majesty.

00:12:51.490 --> 00:12:53.660
Your anger is of little use.

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.760
How can I not be angry?

00:12:55.760 --> 00:12:58.600
We missed a great opportunity.

00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:01.070
They shot themselves in the foot!

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:04.770
Did you see how the king behaved?

00:13:05.110 --> 00:13:07.040
That arrogant look.

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:10.540
I saved him from the life of a simple peasant and made him a king,

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:12.850
and he dares to look like that?

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:14.980
We need to pacify him, since he is rebelling.

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:18.150
I will tighten the rules so that I know my place.

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:25.930
Why waste time taking care of yourself?

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:29.730
There is no trace of effort, it’s worth worrying.

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.900
Invite doctor Pak.

00:13:33.970 --> 00:13:35.400
Yes.

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:45.340
To be honest, the queen came to see me.

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:49.620
That night when I threw myself into the lake.

00:13:54.690 --> 00:13:57.920
Dowager Queen, I

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:02.960
I'll leave the palace.

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:05.970
What are you talking about?

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:08.670
I can't become queen.

00:14:08.670 --> 00:14:11.100
I don’t want such a bitter fate for myself.

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:16.540
I've heard rumors
that you're behaving terribly

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.610
but it was all on purpose,

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:21.450
so as not to become a queen.

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:24.750
How nice.

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:27.550
You thought you could achieve something with this.

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:29.820
You took classes to become a queen.

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:31.690
I don't know why I suddenly changed my mind

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:33.760
and I don’t want to know.

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:37.560
Your destiny was predetermined from birth.

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:40.430
You must become a queen and serve your family.

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:43.840
This is your destiny, this is what you were born for.

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:47.940
Have you taken this position yourself?

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:49.410
No, not myself.

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:52.650
So you can't back down
even if you want to.

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:55.680
If you want to die, die in the palace.

00:14:56.780 --> 00:14:58.650
I thought she said that because

00:14:58.650 --> 00:15:01.960
that young people are now inclined to make mountains out of molehills.

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:04.390
Therefore, I didn’t attach much importance to it.

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:08.830
I couldn't even think that she jumped into the lake,
to commit suicide.

00:15:10.230 --> 00:15:13.770
If she was ready to die
just not to become a queen,

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:17.800
That means her crazy behavior today too...

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:22.140
A way to step down as queen.

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:24.440
If this is the case,

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:28.150
the queen will not escape unpunished.

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:31.780
Wait for me! What if you fall?

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:34.920
I told you, don't rush.

00:15:35.860 --> 00:15:39.330
Who dares to block my path?

00:15:44.760 --> 00:15:46.670
The Dowager Queen.

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:49.700
You won't be able to return home.

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:52.410
-What?
-To the Queen, Jang Bong Hwan,

00:15:52.410 --> 00:15:57.010
ordered to stay here forever until the end of his days

00:15:57.010 --> 00:16:00.950
and live in agony, remaining impotent.

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:10.820
No.

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:13.690
I don't want.

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:19.100
I don't want to be impotent!

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:22.500
Your Majesty!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.870
What a terrible nightmare.

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:30.240
You tried to drown yourself in the lake,

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:32.910
and today they fainted, I was so scared...

00:16:32.910 --> 00:16:35.580
Calm down. I understand how you feel.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:38.220
I will die with you!

00:16:45.930 --> 00:16:47.530
Enough already.

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:50.430
I've had enough tears for today, I can't stand it anymore.

00:16:50.430 --> 00:16:53.830
It’s not contagious, so why did you cry three times?

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:56.400
I fell asleep while I was waiting for you to stop.

00:16:56.400 --> 00:17:00.070
Of course you don't want to see my tears.

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:04.040
You're cute when you smile.

00:17:09.050 --> 00:17:10.520
Where is Court Lady Choi?

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:14.590
She insisted that she would bring you the medicine herself.

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:18.930
Your father stayed with you

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:21.460
and went home only after sunset.

00:17:21.860 --> 00:17:24.830
If only we had woken up a little earlier, we would have seen it.

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:27.430
Thank heavens I didn't see him.

00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:28.870
What?

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:30.740
If he knew what a beautiful body

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:32.870
his priceless daughter was captured by the man's soul,

00:17:32.870 --> 00:17:34.870
I would be upset.

00:17:36.140 --> 00:17:37.740
We must hurry before Lady Choi returns.

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:40.150
The lake has already been filled, hasn't it?

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:42.780
Do you want to go to the lake at this time?

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:46.190
Today is the last day.

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:53.030
-Are you in a good mood?
- Of course.

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:54.930
All that's left is to return home,

00:17:54.930 --> 00:17:57.230
remaining the coolest guy here.

00:17:57.630 --> 00:17:59.060
Oh, exactly.

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:02.170
-Honyoung.
-Yes, queen.

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:05.200
I was able to endure all this thanks to you.

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:08.710
I don't know about the others, but I'll miss you.

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:12.010
Yes, and I will also miss Court Lady Choi.

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:17.180
Hongyong, leave this will to your descendants.

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:18.580
Will?

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:21.850
Buy land in Gangnam.

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:23.390
You have to tell them this.

00:18:23.390 --> 00:18:25.220
Then after 200 years

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:27.390
your heirs will live like rich people.

00:18:28.260 --> 00:18:30.800
That's all I can give you.

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:37.470
Okay, go ahead.

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:40.610
Your Majesty, be careful.

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:42.680
More energetic.

00:18:46.050 --> 00:18:48.750
Hurry up, need to hurry up.

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:55.250
What is this?

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:57.760
Why did we go back to the old way?

00:18:57.760 --> 00:18:59.230
when did I come up with a new system?

00:18:59.230 --> 00:19:00.730
The thing is...

00:19:01.090 --> 00:19:04.160
The well is empty.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:08.870
Because we take water from another

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:11.800
and bring it here, but...

00:19:12.370 --> 00:19:15.670
Will you repeat it again? I heard something wrong.

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:20.250
It sounded like you weren't going to finish today.

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:22.480
Forgive us, queen.

00:19:22.480 --> 00:19:25.320
-Forgive us, queen.
-Forgive us, queen.

00:19:29.490 --> 00:19:32.660
A high-ranking official must keep his word.

00:19:32.660 --> 00:19:35.660
You promised to fill the lake today.

00:19:35.660 --> 00:19:38.260
Nearest well

00:19:38.260 --> 00:19:40.570
It's very, very far from here.

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:43.370
It will take at least 15 days...

00:19:46.970 --> 00:19:48.670
Please execute me!

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:54.150
-Please, execute me!
-Please, execute me.

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:56.480
Why do you keep asking for execution?

00:19:57.650 --> 00:20:00.890
Don’t you believe that I will actually execute you?

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:02.590
Should I demonstrate it to you?

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:05.560
Do you want to experience for yourself what kind of scam happens?

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:13.330
Let's go. I'm sure even an incomplete lake will work.

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:15.370
No, Your Majesty.

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:17.800
Why are you doing this?

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:20.670
I won't let you take your life again.

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:22.940
It's not like that at all.

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:25.550
I'm not trying to die.

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:27.110
What are you trying to do then?

00:20:27.110 --> 00:20:28.650
In short...

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:32.320
I'm trying to survive. That's the only way I can do it!

00:20:38.890 --> 00:20:40.790
You will only pass over my corpse!

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:42.930
Damn, where do you have so much strength?

00:20:42.930 --> 00:20:44.400
Get off me.

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:45.970
If this granny changes her mind

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:50.040
and get rid of the water in the lake again, I’m screwed!

00:20:50.070 --> 00:20:51.870
Help stop the queen!

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:53.470
How dare you touch her?

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:55.710
Your Majesty!

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:58.140
I beg you, no!

00:20:58.140 --> 00:21:00.710
From now on, no quibbles!

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:03.020
I will never tell you “no”!

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:05.080
You can't do that!

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:06.290
She said you wouldn't.

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:09.220
That you can never say “no”!

00:21:09.220 --> 00:21:10.660
Damn it.

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:15.960
It won't work.

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:19.600
Yes, at least tickle it.

00:21:30.410 --> 00:21:33.480
I forgot how to laugh a long time ago.

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:36.320
Crap.

00:21:36.550 --> 00:21:39.090
I won't. Let's go.

00:21:39.090 --> 00:21:40.550
That's it.

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:42.990
Damn, I'm stuck.

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:46.660
So you don't want me to go there?

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:50.800
Great.

00:22:02.940 --> 00:22:04.440
Raise your head.

00:22:04.580 --> 00:22:06.150
Straighten your back.

00:22:11.120 --> 00:22:12.720
Can you swim?

00:22:18.990 --> 00:22:20.530
Is that all?

00:22:20.630 --> 00:22:24.760
I'll go further, it will be deeper there.

00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:26.870
Okay, move it.

00:22:32.310 --> 00:22:34.070
-Fathers.
-Yes, here it is!

00:22:35.110 --> 00:22:37.810
I tripped!

00:22:38.610 --> 00:22:41.150
- Bummer.
-Your Majesty.

00:22:42.150 --> 00:22:46.020
The Queen Dowager calls for your presence at once.

00:22:46.020 --> 00:22:47.990
Damn you!

00:22:48.420 --> 00:22:51.860
Lee Senman. This name backfired on me.

00:22:51.960 --> 00:22:53.430
Crap.

00:22:53.430 --> 00:22:56.060
-Miracle.
-What bliss.

00:22:56.300 --> 00:22:57.800
Like this.

00:23:00.130 --> 00:23:01.630
What's happened?

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:05.170
Do you sometimes have this feeling too?

00:23:05.940 --> 00:23:09.240
When everyone is fussing around, but no one cares about you.

00:23:10.080 --> 00:23:13.080
Sir, you are the center of the universe for me.

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:17.520
Well, sensitive people like me

00:23:17.520 --> 00:23:20.150
sometimes they make mistakes in their premonitions, like today.

00:23:23.890 --> 00:23:25.760
I didn't order naengmyeon.

00:23:25.990 --> 00:23:28.790
You make me happy every night by allowing me to serve you.

00:23:28.790 --> 00:23:30.430
This is from the bottom of my heart.

00:23:30.560 --> 00:23:32.330
Let me say something.

00:23:32.330 --> 00:23:35.300
It may seem like I'm hanging around here for fun, but that's not the case.

00:23:37.770 --> 00:23:42.010
I'm just here to find out something

00:23:42.010 --> 00:23:44.180
about Lee Senman, who suddenly disappeared.

00:23:44.640 --> 00:23:49.010
But why are you looking for him so desperately?

00:23:49.220 --> 00:23:52.550
It feels like behind his disappearance

00:23:52.550 --> 00:23:55.720
there is an important secret hidden.

00:23:56.190 --> 00:23:58.620
My sixth sense tells me

00:23:59.190 --> 00:24:01.630
what is this Lee Sanman

00:24:02.230 --> 00:24:04.500
at the very center of the problem.

00:24:05.130 --> 00:24:07.930
-What problem?
-I have no idea.

00:24:08.470 --> 00:24:09.870
What?

00:24:19.180 --> 00:24:22.180
They're checking me now.

00:24:23.050 --> 00:24:26.150
-About today...
-It's my fault.

00:24:31.620 --> 00:24:34.890
I forced you to marry him against your will.

00:24:35.260 --> 00:24:38.000
Don't you really want to be queen?

00:24:38.000 --> 00:24:40.170
So much so that you are ready to say goodbye to life?

00:24:40.570 --> 00:24:42.600
And be deposed as queen?

00:24:42.600 --> 00:24:45.370
Did she try to commit suicide so she wouldn't be queen?

00:24:45.370 --> 00:24:46.810
Great.

00:24:46.840 --> 00:24:49.610
If you want it so desperately
I will let you leave the palace.

00:24:49.980 --> 00:24:52.110
I will bring you down.

00:24:52.610 --> 00:24:55.310
You will be confined in your home

00:24:55.310 --> 00:24:57.350
and you won’t step outside the threshold for the rest of your life.

00:24:57.350 --> 00:24:58.380
No.

00:24:58.380 --> 00:25:00.620
I can only get back through the lake here.

00:25:00.620 --> 00:25:03.790
I don't remember this.

00:25:03.790 --> 00:25:06.960
After falling into the lake, I forgot about everything.

00:25:07.090 --> 00:25:08.690
Memories didn't come back

00:25:08.690 --> 00:25:11.560
but did you remember that you wanted to commit suicide?

00:25:12.830 --> 00:25:15.100
I still have a feeling of pain.

00:25:15.130 --> 00:25:17.870
And I'm sure I embroidered this note.

00:25:18.040 --> 00:25:21.610
But I don’t know why I wanted to commit suicide.

00:25:21.670 --> 00:25:23.310
If you don't remember anything,

00:25:23.310 --> 00:25:25.680
why did you interfere?

00:25:28.380 --> 00:25:30.080
If you don't give a reason,

00:25:30.120 --> 00:25:32.590
I will consider that you opposed me.

00:25:32.590 --> 00:25:33.590
No.

00:25:33.590 --> 00:25:36.290
And I had no intention of resisting you.

00:25:36.290 --> 00:25:40.030
Today you undermined my authority.

00:25:40.390 --> 00:25:41.890
I need to fix this.

00:25:41.890 --> 00:25:44.730
But I don't have a solution. Damn, nothing comes to mind.

00:25:44.730 --> 00:25:48.330
And I can't forgive you for that.

00:25:50.300 --> 00:25:53.440
I deserve to die, Your Majesty.

00:25:53.740 --> 00:25:56.240
Take my life.

00:25:56.580 --> 00:25:59.110
I'm confused because of the lack of memories

00:25:59.110 --> 00:26:00.880
but I can't turn away from my kind

00:26:00.880 --> 00:26:03.250
and from my husband.

00:26:03.850 --> 00:26:05.750
Please punish me

00:26:05.750 --> 00:26:09.920
give poison to get rid of this pain.

00:26:13.030 --> 00:26:15.860
They certainly don't want to overthrow the queen.

00:26:15.860 --> 00:26:18.130
Is it that easy for you to give up your life?

00:26:18.360 --> 00:26:20.100
She threw herself into the lake.

00:26:20.100 --> 00:26:21.830
Now do you want to drink poison?

00:26:21.830 --> 00:26:24.340
Why are you so weak?

00:26:24.340 --> 00:26:27.210
They want to make sure
that they have power over the queen.

00:26:27.210 --> 00:26:29.170
My stupid decision to say goodbye to life

00:26:29.170 --> 00:26:31.640
gave rise to all this misunderstanding.

00:26:31.980 --> 00:26:33.710
My action is worthy of death.

00:26:33.710 --> 00:26:38.450
I beg you to execute me, Your Majesty.

00:26:38.450 --> 00:26:41.350
Your death won't fix anything.

00:26:41.350 --> 00:26:42.420
Because of this trick

00:26:42.420 --> 00:26:44.690
the Queen Mother will gain an advantage.

00:26:44.690 --> 00:26:46.890
But this will not only affect you.

00:26:46.890 --> 00:26:51.060
This will affect the entire Kim family.

00:26:51.560 --> 00:26:54.870
-I'll try...
-Calm down, please.

00:26:59.200 --> 00:27:04.580
I'll ask you for the last time.

00:27:07.050 --> 00:27:09.780
Do you really want to leave the palace?

00:27:10.720 --> 00:27:12.350
I want

00:27:14.350 --> 00:27:15.990
live in a palace.

00:27:17.690 --> 00:27:20.130
What do you think, Your Majesty?

00:27:29.340 --> 00:27:32.570
Since I have no memories left, I will become a new person.

00:27:35.640 --> 00:27:38.710
I will become the perfect queen.

00:27:41.210 --> 00:27:44.480
I don't believe in empty promises.

00:27:44.480 --> 00:27:46.350
I'll prove it in practice.

00:27:48.250 --> 00:27:50.960
Please give her a chance, Your Majesty.

00:27:53.830 --> 00:27:55.060
Fine.

00:27:55.060 --> 00:27:58.800
Thank you for your kindness.

00:28:00.230 --> 00:28:02.500
I won't bother you anymore.

00:28:02.500 --> 00:28:04.870
There's nothing to worry about.

00:28:08.270 --> 00:28:09.410
"Leave Your False Self"

00:28:09.410 --> 00:28:12.240
Because we no longer have weaknesses.

00:28:13.050 --> 00:28:14.750
We will eliminate

00:28:17.380 --> 00:28:19.220
any problem.

00:28:31.030 --> 00:28:32.900
He will do it.

00:28:33.100 --> 00:28:34.700
This is a warning.

00:28:49.950 --> 00:28:51.880
Everything is so unclear.

00:28:53.550 --> 00:28:55.850
Shall we light more lanterns, Your Majesty?

00:28:55.990 --> 00:28:58.720
No. This is me talking about my future.

00:29:05.430 --> 00:29:09.030
Prince Yeonpyeong and his men searched the palace.

00:29:09.070 --> 00:29:10.900
His people?

00:29:11.070 --> 00:29:13.110
Were these the royal guards?

00:29:13.310 --> 00:29:15.440
They are well trained.

00:29:15.440 --> 00:29:16.910
How many?

00:29:17.280 --> 00:29:18.880
A little.

00:29:19.580 --> 00:29:21.850
-Seven.
-For all this time

00:29:21.850 --> 00:29:25.050
they secretly trained only seven?

00:29:28.550 --> 00:29:30.460
You're out of medicine.

00:29:30.490 --> 00:29:34.030
If it weren't for the disease, you would have become an excellent warrior.

00:29:34.030 --> 00:29:35.590
I'm still alive

00:29:35.890 --> 00:29:38.360
only thanks to your help.

00:29:38.960 --> 00:29:40.430
Thank you.

00:29:45.900 --> 00:29:49.010
If you make a mistake again,

00:29:49.040 --> 00:29:51.480
You won't get any more medicine.

00:29:52.110 --> 00:29:53.710
I'll remember.

00:30:08.690 --> 00:30:10.530
Until now

00:30:11.300 --> 00:30:15.670
we thought that the queen fell into the lake to frame Concubine Cho.

00:30:16.140 --> 00:30:20.510
We thought she was deliberately lying about losing her memories.

00:30:20.540 --> 00:30:23.010
I can't believe she tried to commit suicide.

00:30:23.010 --> 00:30:26.210
Perhaps this is how she wanted to gain your trust.

00:30:26.410 --> 00:30:29.550
Do you think she knew that I would protect Concubine Cho?

00:30:29.550 --> 00:30:31.880
Don't stand up for her

00:30:32.120 --> 00:30:34.620
the queen would have blamed her.

00:30:34.620 --> 00:30:36.390
She realized

00:30:36.790 --> 00:30:39.290
that can influence you in this way.

00:30:41.790 --> 00:30:45.300
Prince Yeonpyeong, you see

00:30:45.300 --> 00:30:47.630
There is evil intent in every action of the queen.

00:30:47.630 --> 00:30:49.200
Queen -

00:30:49.700 --> 00:30:51.670
support of the Kim family.

00:30:52.370 --> 00:30:54.340
What kind of people are they?

00:30:54.470 --> 00:30:57.840
They are the ones who massacred our entire family.

00:30:57.840 --> 00:30:59.410
I never

00:31:00.680 --> 00:31:03.220
I won't be able to forget this.

00:31:05.350 --> 00:31:07.350
I won't forget this either.

00:31:07.590 --> 00:31:10.020
But look what the queen did.

00:31:10.120 --> 00:31:13.830
Despite my attempt to kill her and my enmity with Concubine Cho,

00:31:13.830 --> 00:31:16.360
she revealed the truth for our sake.

00:31:17.060 --> 00:31:20.800
Still think your hostility towards her

00:31:22.330 --> 00:31:24.170
deserved?

00:31:25.540 --> 00:31:29.010
-Your Majesty.
-If it was a suicide attempt,

00:31:29.010 --> 00:31:31.880
then I killed the queen twice.

00:31:58.100 --> 00:31:59.970
Why are you here?

00:31:59.970 --> 00:32:02.570
I need to talk to you.

00:32:02.570 --> 00:32:05.040
You're only making things more complicated.

00:32:05.240 --> 00:32:08.380
My fate is already in the hands of your family.

00:32:09.750 --> 00:32:12.820
Next time I'll just pass on the letter.

00:32:13.690 --> 00:32:15.420
You don't like me

00:32:16.420 --> 00:32:18.520
because I am from the Andong family of Kim?

00:32:18.520 --> 00:32:20.660
I didn't say I didn't like you.

00:32:20.830 --> 00:32:22.890
Then do you like me?

00:32:30.400 --> 00:32:33.140
If I were not from the Andong family of Kim,

00:32:34.510 --> 00:32:36.840
Would you like me?

00:32:37.340 --> 00:32:39.110
No, I don't think so.

00:32:39.140 --> 00:32:42.150
You became queen thanks to your family.

00:32:43.680 --> 00:32:46.320
I put in a lot of effort.

00:32:46.620 --> 00:32:49.420
I didn't want to become queen because of my family.

00:32:49.720 --> 00:32:52.720
I dedicated my whole life to this, no matter what they say.

00:32:53.830 --> 00:32:57.260
Tomorrow you will get what you so desperately wanted.

00:32:58.800 --> 00:33:01.770
It's late, and tomorrow will be a difficult day.

00:33:02.300 --> 00:33:04.340
Return to your quarters.

00:33:08.310 --> 00:33:10.610
You must love me.

00:33:15.450 --> 00:33:17.780
Is this an order?

00:33:24.220 --> 00:33:28.990
My indifference made her jump into the lake.

00:33:29.590 --> 00:33:34.470
If she tried to commit suicide because of your indifference,

00:33:34.930 --> 00:33:36.970
she would just jump into the lake.

00:33:36.970 --> 00:33:39.740
But she forged the letter and fell in front of Concubine Cho.

00:33:39.740 --> 00:33:42.240
I see an ulterior motive here.

00:33:42.910 --> 00:33:44.410
Motive, you say.

00:33:46.210 --> 00:33:48.510
I need to see the queen.

00:33:49.280 --> 00:33:52.320
The attackers don't hide their smile.

00:33:52.380 --> 00:33:55.190
If there was an ulterior motive behind her actions,

00:33:56.420 --> 00:33:59.260
I can tell by her behavior.

00:33:59.690 --> 00:34:03.090
Take care of Concubine Cho for now.

00:34:23.620 --> 00:34:26.650
Pretend to be the perfect queen for 15 days.

00:34:26.790 --> 00:34:28.650
Can I handle it?

00:34:28.720 --> 00:34:32.490
If I can’t, then I’ll remain in this suffocating body,

00:34:32.620 --> 00:34:36.630
Moreover, behind bars as a deposed queen in the Joseon era.

00:34:41.070 --> 00:34:44.340
He dug his own grave. Who else is to blame?

00:34:44.600 --> 00:34:48.970
Your Majesty, the king has arrived.

00:34:48.970 --> 00:34:53.010
Of course Cheoljong.
It's all his fault.

00:34:53.250 --> 00:34:56.420
I wouldn't stand up for her
if only he weren't so cool.

00:34:56.420 --> 00:34:57.850
Open it up.

00:34:57.950 --> 00:35:01.620
And even before that, he completely blundered.

00:35:04.090 --> 00:35:05.590
This woman wouldn't try

00:35:05.590 --> 00:35:07.230
drown himself, if he were nicer to her.

00:35:07.230 --> 00:35:09.930
-No, if he had before...
-My queen.

00:35:10.800 --> 00:35:12.800
How do you feel?

00:35:14.130 --> 00:35:17.640
You put a sword to my neck,
where does this concern come from?

00:35:20.270 --> 00:35:23.440
I haven't had a single quiet day here.

00:35:23.440 --> 00:35:25.580
I just opened my eyes, and tomorrow is the wedding.

00:35:25.580 --> 00:35:28.610
The husband with whom I share the same blanket is trying to kill me.

00:35:28.610 --> 00:35:32.120
And even your own family
threatens to overthrow me.

00:35:33.750 --> 00:35:34.820
Overthrow?

00:35:34.820 --> 00:35:36.660
What? Tempting?

00:35:36.660 --> 00:35:40.560
What a good opportunity to replace me with Cho Hwajin, right?

00:35:40.560 --> 00:35:43.060
Why are you so excited?

00:35:43.100 --> 00:35:45.430
I didn't come to fight with you.

00:35:45.430 --> 00:35:48.230
Just looking at you makes me angry.

00:35:48.230 --> 00:35:49.400
Have you thought about it?

00:35:49.400 --> 00:35:51.070
You who tried to kill me

00:35:51.070 --> 00:35:53.640
and the one for whom you are ready to die.

00:35:54.140 --> 00:35:56.310
I'm about to die trying to save you two.

00:35:56.310 --> 00:35:59.410
Yes, they will kill me before I commit suicide.

00:35:59.740 --> 00:36:04.350
Anyone in my place would be angry right now if he weren't Buddha.

00:36:06.150 --> 00:36:08.390
I understand that you are very angry with me.

00:36:08.390 --> 00:36:09.790
Stop.

00:36:10.020 --> 00:36:11.320
No need.

00:36:11.320 --> 00:36:13.160
Don't you dare say

00:36:13.160 --> 00:36:15.290
that you understand me.

00:36:17.460 --> 00:36:19.060
You should have understood me

00:36:19.060 --> 00:36:22.330
before putting the sword to my neck.

00:36:22.370 --> 00:36:26.200
No. You should have understood this woman before

00:36:26.540 --> 00:36:30.210
how she tried to commit suicide.

00:36:31.440 --> 00:36:34.680
The moment has passed. There's no point in saying anything.

00:36:35.610 --> 00:36:39.480
Leave already. I was tired while I was angry.

00:36:41.950 --> 00:36:44.860
I'll come back when you feel better.

00:36:46.890 --> 00:36:50.330
Don't come unless you're ready to beg on your knees.

00:36:52.600 --> 00:36:54.270
I'll come back.

00:36:56.170 --> 00:36:59.970
She told me not to come!

00:37:30.600 --> 00:37:33.370
Are they refilling the lake?

00:37:34.240 --> 00:37:38.280
Her Majesty asked the Queen Dowager about this.

00:37:38.280 --> 00:37:39.710
For what?

00:37:40.010 --> 00:37:42.010
I don't know exactly

00:37:42.550 --> 00:37:45.720
but I heard Her Majesty went to the lake

00:37:45.720 --> 00:37:49.220
and personally monitored everything.

00:38:04.200 --> 00:38:05.670
Your Majesty.

00:38:06.470 --> 00:38:08.840
Sorry to bother you.

00:38:13.080 --> 00:38:15.350
I was afraid that I might lose you.

00:38:19.420 --> 00:38:21.490
Are you injured?

00:38:22.390 --> 00:38:24.360
Your wound hurts more,

00:38:25.490 --> 00:38:28.190
than mine.

00:38:30.500 --> 00:38:32.060
Today

00:38:33.100 --> 00:38:35.830
it was very hard for you.

00:38:36.570 --> 00:38:40.670
I'm sorry I got you into this.

00:38:41.570 --> 00:38:44.040
It must have been so hard for you

00:38:44.040 --> 00:38:46.580
because of all these problems in the palace.

00:38:46.580 --> 00:38:49.080
I don't want you to suffer.

00:38:49.550 --> 00:38:52.080
So don't do it again.

00:38:52.520 --> 00:38:55.290
If you sacrifice yourself for me,

00:38:55.550 --> 00:38:57.860
How will I deal with this?

00:38:58.060 --> 00:39:02.560
I won't do what you're afraid of.

00:39:03.730 --> 00:39:05.900
Until everything settles down,

00:39:06.230 --> 00:39:09.300
Prince Yeonpyeong will personally guard you.

00:39:11.840 --> 00:39:14.910
What about Ovol?

00:39:15.210 --> 00:39:17.610
-Well...
- Mister Hong has arrived.

00:39:18.440 --> 00:39:19.880
Come in.

00:39:23.110 --> 00:39:24.480
As Concubine Cho's maid?

00:39:24.480 --> 00:39:26.780
She's in the infirmary now.

00:39:28.620 --> 00:39:30.690
My brother will take care of everything.

00:39:31.420 --> 00:39:32.920
Thank you.

00:39:36.930 --> 00:39:39.000
Have you met the queen?

00:39:40.200 --> 00:39:41.230
Yes.

00:39:41.230 --> 00:39:43.900
-How is she?
-She was angry.

00:39:44.740 --> 00:39:46.200
-What?
-Blamed me

00:39:46.200 --> 00:39:48.270
that he drove her to suicide.

00:39:48.270 --> 00:39:51.180
Hates me for trying to kill her.

00:39:51.180 --> 00:39:53.380
Emotions overwhelm her.

00:39:53.510 --> 00:39:55.580
If she wanted to win me over,

00:39:55.580 --> 00:39:57.250
I wouldn't behave like that.

00:39:57.250 --> 00:39:58.750
And one more thing

00:39:59.050 --> 00:40:02.020
The Kims are threatening to overthrow her.

00:40:02.820 --> 00:40:05.290
Kim Byungin doesn't know yet

00:40:05.290 --> 00:40:08.030
that that scrap is from your clothes.

00:40:08.130 --> 00:40:09.560
Fine.

00:40:10.130 --> 00:40:12.360
The Queen said nothing.

00:40:12.360 --> 00:40:14.200
I don't know her intentions

00:40:14.430 --> 00:40:17.100
but it seems to work on its own.

00:40:18.000 --> 00:40:19.470
I thought I'd understand

00:40:19.470 --> 00:40:22.540
what kind of person she is, based on her actions.

00:40:23.710 --> 00:40:25.480
But she only puzzled me more.

00:40:32.650 --> 00:40:34.820
Father, this is Benin.

00:40:34.820 --> 00:40:36.450
Yes. Come in.

00:40:46.560 --> 00:40:49.130
I thought you quit smoking.

00:40:49.870 --> 00:40:51.340
Quit.

00:40:58.480 --> 00:41:00.510
I'm sorry about today.

00:41:01.480 --> 00:41:03.510
Why are you apologizing?

00:41:04.080 --> 00:41:06.320
What will you do next?

00:41:07.150 --> 00:41:09.090
I'll try to reason with her.

00:41:09.090 --> 00:41:12.090
And if she doesn't understand, she won't exist.

00:41:13.460 --> 00:41:16.260
Who are you talking about?

00:41:17.030 --> 00:41:18.730
About anyone.

00:41:18.730 --> 00:41:21.370
There is no such thing as an ally for centuries.

00:41:24.770 --> 00:41:28.140
I'm afraid now is not the time for this,

00:41:28.370 --> 00:41:30.270
but I have to tell.

00:41:30.780 --> 00:41:32.340
Fine. What's there?

00:41:32.810 --> 00:41:36.950
I decided how far I would go with my dream.

00:41:37.180 --> 00:41:39.650
I'm very glad to hear this.

00:41:39.980 --> 00:41:41.390
What kind of position?

00:41:41.390 --> 00:41:43.490
I will be the head of the Detective Department.

00:41:43.660 --> 00:41:45.420
Detective department?

00:41:45.990 --> 00:41:49.260
Is being a warrior everything you dreamed of?

00:41:49.260 --> 00:41:52.600
I'll start with a position I can handle

00:41:52.600 --> 00:41:54.630
and choose my path.

00:41:54.900 --> 00:41:56.300
How's that?

00:41:58.040 --> 00:42:01.340
You say you want to choose your own path?

00:42:10.580 --> 00:42:12.950
The royal concubine has arrived.

00:42:15.220 --> 00:42:17.020
Do not move.

00:42:23.500 --> 00:42:24.930
Your Highness.

00:42:30.470 --> 00:42:31.900
Sorry.

00:42:32.500 --> 00:42:35.370
I had to stand until the last.

00:42:36.170 --> 00:42:38.840
Your broken knees are proof.

00:42:39.640 --> 00:42:41.110
I know.

00:42:42.650 --> 00:42:44.580
It's nothing.

00:42:45.180 --> 00:42:47.390
A couple of days with medicinal herbs,

00:42:47.390 --> 00:42:50.050
and I'll be up in no time.

00:42:50.790 --> 00:42:54.260
Yes. I have no doubt you will get better.

00:42:55.890 --> 00:42:58.200
Who could treat you so cruelly?

00:42:58.860 --> 00:43:02.170
I didn’t see his face, he was wearing a mask.

00:43:03.330 --> 00:43:05.740
But I remember the voice.

00:43:06.700 --> 00:43:08.140
Your Highness.

00:43:08.940 --> 00:43:10.540
I'm sorry for saying this.

00:43:10.980 --> 00:43:13.180
If someone not from the royal family gets hurt,

00:43:13.210 --> 00:43:15.410
he cannot stay in the palace.

00:43:15.850 --> 00:43:18.720
But how can she leave in such a state?

00:43:18.720 --> 00:43:20.950
This is a palace custom.

00:43:21.650 --> 00:43:24.490
You can't expect compassion in this place.

00:43:31.200 --> 00:43:33.160
If anyone is on the way

00:43:33.360 --> 00:43:35.970
tries to harm you, use it as a bribe.

00:43:36.200 --> 00:43:38.040
You will successfully leave the palace,

00:43:38.040 --> 00:43:39.800
take advantage of this to live in comfort.

00:43:39.800 --> 00:43:41.870
No, too much.

00:43:42.640 --> 00:43:44.810
I will send a letter to my family.

00:43:44.880 --> 00:43:46.610
Don't worry.

00:43:49.550 --> 00:43:52.680
Thank you for your service.

00:43:53.150 --> 00:43:56.250
I'm too ashamed to look at Mr. Cho's face.

00:43:56.960 --> 00:43:58.560
I can't go.

00:43:59.620 --> 00:44:03.260
Ovol, you and I grew up together.

00:44:03.660 --> 00:44:06.000
You are my family.

00:44:06.800 --> 00:44:08.500
You have to hang in there

00:44:09.070 --> 00:44:10.670
so that I can too.

00:44:11.900 --> 00:44:14.310
Be brave for me.

00:44:14.910 --> 00:44:16.510
You must live.

00:44:18.280 --> 00:44:19.940
Do it for me.

00:44:49.710 --> 00:44:52.180
-What happened?
-Yesterday I was a madhouse.

00:44:52.180 --> 00:44:53.780
Queen...

00:44:56.450 --> 00:44:57.920
My lord.

00:44:58.620 --> 00:45:00.180
Have you heard?

00:45:00.180 --> 00:45:03.490
His Majesty through the eyes of thunder and lightning
threw at the dowager queen.

00:45:03.490 --> 00:45:05.290
The eyes were like apples.

00:45:06.760 --> 00:45:08.660
Hey you.

00:45:08.930 --> 00:45:12.760
His Majesty picked it up right in front of the Queen and...

00:45:15.570 --> 00:45:17.770
Royal chef, have you heard?

00:45:17.770 --> 00:45:21.710
His Majesty grabbed the sword,
and the Queen Dowager...

00:45:24.340 --> 00:45:25.880
Did you hear what happened in the Tonggunjong Hall?

00:45:25.880 --> 00:45:27.710
I heard they do this all the time.

00:45:42.730 --> 00:45:46.600
Will be appointed today
head of the Detective Department.

00:45:46.800 --> 00:45:48.300
Will?

00:45:49.630 --> 00:45:51.740
We have a request for an appointment.

00:45:52.100 --> 00:45:53.470
And who was recommended?

00:45:53.470 --> 00:45:56.370
for the post of head of the Detective Department?

00:45:56.370 --> 00:45:59.510
Byonin from the Andong Kim clan.

00:46:05.520 --> 00:46:07.890
Quite unexpected.

00:46:07.920 --> 00:46:10.320
I'm sure there are many candidates for this position.

00:46:10.320 --> 00:46:13.590
If I appoint as head the one
who passed the civil servant exam,

00:46:13.590 --> 00:46:15.360
there will be complaints, don’t you think?

00:46:15.360 --> 00:46:18.730
We unanimously agreed
with this recommendation.

00:46:20.430 --> 00:46:22.100
Unanimously?

00:46:22.700 --> 00:46:27.170
I didn't expect such a harmonious relationship
among my subjects.

00:46:28.170 --> 00:46:32.210
I heard he is a wonderful person.

00:46:36.580 --> 00:46:39.680
Is the royal notice of appointment already prepared?

00:46:40.020 --> 00:46:44.560
To keep up with your fast-paced decisions,

00:46:44.560 --> 00:46:47.320
maybe I should cut down on my sleep time.

00:46:47.460 --> 00:46:49.430
Don't say that.

00:46:49.430 --> 00:46:52.560
You need to take care of your health
and produce an heir.

00:46:53.760 --> 00:46:57.600
Not a king, but a breeding horse.

00:47:12.020 --> 00:47:18.020
You have always been humble.
Don't lose it - humility.

00:47:18.090 --> 00:47:20.960
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:47:30.270 --> 00:47:32.040
Pungyang Cho clan

00:47:32.040 --> 00:47:34.370
brought trouble upon himself.

00:47:34.370 --> 00:47:36.840
Because of the concubine's false confession

00:47:37.610 --> 00:47:40.040
we have suffered such humiliation.

00:47:47.220 --> 00:47:51.260
Failure is a cause, not a result.

00:47:51.390 --> 00:47:52.820
What?

00:47:53.090 --> 00:47:55.960
That's what the Queen Mother said.

00:47:56.290 --> 00:47:58.500
We agreed with the appointment of Kim Byungin

00:47:58.500 --> 00:48:01.900
and helped them strengthen their positions,

00:48:02.200 --> 00:48:04.130
because they lost.

00:48:04.140 --> 00:48:07.300
The more defeats, the less
our chances of winning.

00:48:07.470 --> 00:48:08.940
She said,

00:48:09.670 --> 00:48:12.480
we must take the first step.

00:48:40.200 --> 00:48:42.410
Do you think Ovol will be able to recover?

00:48:42.410 --> 00:48:44.380
I'll check how she's feeling.

00:48:44.380 --> 00:48:47.440
She is active, so she constantly runs around.

00:48:48.550 --> 00:48:51.250
Now he can’t do that anymore.

00:48:52.050 --> 00:48:54.850
If she had not come to the palace with me...

00:48:56.920 --> 00:48:58.890
Don't think about it too often.

00:48:59.120 --> 00:49:01.290
Sometimes thoughts can drive you into a swamp.

00:49:01.890 --> 00:49:04.800
And the harder you fight, the deeper it goes.
It will hurt even more.

00:49:06.660 --> 00:49:08.430
What are you doing

00:49:08.470 --> 00:49:11.300
to clear your head from the abundance of thoughts?

00:49:11.700 --> 00:49:13.170
I

00:49:14.510 --> 00:49:16.410
I'm going to Mr. Hong.

00:49:16.740 --> 00:49:18.940
He can comfort you.

00:49:18.940 --> 00:49:21.710
He's such a fool.

00:49:22.410 --> 00:49:24.520
It drives me crazy.

00:49:24.720 --> 00:49:26.420
And when I take it out on him,

00:49:27.920 --> 00:49:30.550
then I get out of the swamp without even noticing it.

00:49:33.820 --> 00:49:38.030
Then can you make me angry?

00:49:40.260 --> 00:49:42.700
-This...
-Or...

00:50:33.880 --> 00:50:35.890
Don't move.

00:50:54.170 --> 00:50:55.740
I'm done.

00:51:00.240 --> 00:51:01.650
What's happened?

00:51:01.650 --> 00:51:04.850
It's okay.

00:51:08.050 --> 00:51:09.650
Does something hurt?

00:51:10.920 --> 00:51:13.990
You can't touch me.

00:51:17.860 --> 00:51:20.960
I got a cramp.

00:51:22.470 --> 00:51:25.300
It was a long time, right?

00:51:25.300 --> 00:51:26.840
Thank heavens.

00:51:28.110 --> 00:51:30.640
You were so focused that you forgot about time.

00:51:44.860 --> 00:51:48.060
If you want to embroider,
then I had to go to the Daejojeon Hall.

00:51:48.060 --> 00:51:50.630
What did you forget in the kitchen?

00:51:56.400 --> 00:51:59.100
Do you really embroider anything?

00:52:01.940 --> 00:52:04.780
I promised to transform myself into a model queen.

00:52:06.240 --> 00:52:08.110
Exemplary, right?

00:52:09.850 --> 00:52:12.980
Is there nothing to do? Give me some work?

00:52:12.980 --> 00:52:14.720
My back.

00:52:15.050 --> 00:52:17.420
And when will I figure all this out?

00:52:19.160 --> 00:52:20.720
What's happened?

00:52:23.060 --> 00:52:25.700
-Bring it in.
-Wait.

00:52:34.840 --> 00:52:36.970
Is this from Dongmyeongjeong Hall?

00:52:36.970 --> 00:52:38.710
-Yes, Your Majesty.
-Come on.

00:52:44.480 --> 00:52:46.620
She tasted my dishes

00:52:46.620 --> 00:52:49.090
the old ones now seem boring to her.

00:53:00.030 --> 00:53:02.130
Okay. Take this to the stables.

00:53:02.130 --> 00:53:05.900
If they are a palanquin for food
cover with a blanket of this size,

00:53:05.900 --> 00:53:07.540
the food will not cool down.

00:53:07.540 --> 00:53:09.370
Tell them to try.

00:53:09.370 --> 00:53:10.840
Fine.

00:53:14.140 --> 00:53:16.480
Will you rush to the lake as soon as you get rid of me?

00:53:16.650 --> 00:53:19.480
Have you ever seen anyone work so hard and plan to die?

00:53:19.650 --> 00:53:22.050
And you seem to have forgotten
this has become the norm,

00:53:22.050 --> 00:53:24.290
but I’m somehow under CCTV cameras.

00:53:32.830 --> 00:53:34.830
What are you even worried about?

00:53:40.270 --> 00:53:44.070
Well, let's go create miracles?

00:53:53.020 --> 00:53:54.520
Your Majesty!

00:53:55.390 --> 00:53:56.820
Yes!

00:54:06.900 --> 00:54:08.370
Your Majesty!

00:54:08.670 --> 00:54:10.900
Hey there. Did you chop the meat?

00:54:10.900 --> 00:54:12.400
Yes.

00:54:12.770 --> 00:54:14.340
Get here quickly.

00:54:15.610 --> 00:54:17.540
Bring me some salt.

00:54:17.540 --> 00:54:20.010
The Queen wants me to serve it to her first.

00:54:27.120 --> 00:54:28.590
That's it.

00:54:29.750 --> 00:54:32.120
Well, well, do what you want.

00:54:32.920 --> 00:54:34.930
Let's see what happens.

00:54:45.000 --> 00:54:48.040
Maybe ask the queen to cook?

00:54:50.040 --> 00:54:53.610
Your Majesty, this is the Chief Inspector.

00:54:53.610 --> 00:54:57.780
The Queen has prepared lunch for you.

00:55:01.250 --> 00:55:03.790
Should I tell him to take it away?

00:55:06.560 --> 00:55:07.990
Mommies.

00:55:07.990 --> 00:55:09.530
What's happened?

00:55:11.160 --> 00:55:14.160
Well, there is no delicacy at all.

00:55:16.600 --> 00:55:18.070
Your Majesty.

00:55:18.170 --> 00:55:21.770
Your lunch arrived, but...

00:55:35.650 --> 00:55:37.390
Be careful.

00:55:40.720 --> 00:55:43.260
And this...

00:56:08.690 --> 00:56:11.050
The queen said that

00:56:11.050 --> 00:56:16.930
The theme of today's lunch is HSNV.

00:56:17.630 --> 00:56:20.060
HSNV?

00:56:21.130 --> 00:56:23.500
I've never heard of this before.

00:56:23.500 --> 00:56:25.070
Is this Mencius?

00:56:25.170 --> 00:56:28.510
No, it's not.
Maybe from the Analects of Confucius?

00:56:29.210 --> 00:56:30.570
This means that

00:56:30.570 --> 00:56:34.240
food is crispy on the outside

00:56:34.240 --> 00:56:36.450
and tender inside.

00:56:37.410 --> 00:56:39.920
Is it true?

00:56:49.760 --> 00:56:51.190
The food palanquin has arrived!

00:57:03.770 --> 00:57:06.040
Here. Take the plates.

00:57:09.880 --> 00:57:11.480
Carefully.

00:57:14.450 --> 00:57:15.850
Your Majesty.

00:57:16.090 --> 00:57:19.260
She was very pleased and praised you.

00:57:21.260 --> 00:57:24.030
I saw a palanquin for food

00:57:24.030 --> 00:57:26.460
and asked how you feel about it
such a wonderful idea came.

00:57:26.460 --> 00:57:28.300
The stump was clear, the result was obvious.

00:57:28.300 --> 00:57:31.530
This thing was popular
in competitive Korea.

00:57:33.540 --> 00:57:35.710
Joseon delivery man.

00:57:36.910 --> 00:57:40.680
Oh, how proud I am of myself.

00:57:42.050 --> 00:57:43.950
Generally speaking, women from the royal family

00:57:43.950 --> 00:57:45.050
should always be modest.

00:57:45.050 --> 00:57:46.480
you on me

00:57:46.650 --> 00:57:48.590
Are you grumbling now, or what?

00:57:49.490 --> 00:57:53.920
Should we be modest?
That was the question.

00:57:54.320 --> 00:57:57.860
Nope. Life is hard, even if
you live off your pride.

00:58:00.230 --> 00:58:03.370
I have no idea what he's talking about
but it still infuriates.

00:58:04.330 --> 00:58:08.210
We should be glad that Ovol was able to survive.

00:58:08.210 --> 00:58:10.270
This is a ray of hope in the darkness of failure.

00:58:11.410 --> 00:58:14.710
I'm sure after what happened

00:58:14.710 --> 00:58:17.980
you understand better now
What kind of people are the Kim clan?

00:58:18.280 --> 00:58:21.490
I didn't think they were ready to go this far.

00:58:21.490 --> 00:58:23.650
You must be scared.

00:58:23.650 --> 00:58:26.860
However, this is just the beginning.

00:58:27.360 --> 00:58:33.100
They will not forget this defeat.

00:58:34.630 --> 00:58:39.000
There are rumors that the deceased king
did not die from illness.

00:58:40.740 --> 00:58:42.170
It turns out...

00:58:44.270 --> 00:58:48.680
He believed that the Kim clan was a plague on Joseon's body.

00:58:49.510 --> 00:58:51.280
Do you know what you did wrong?

00:58:51.280 --> 00:58:52.950
He deprived Kim Hong-geun of power

00:58:52.950 --> 00:58:54.520
and sentenced him to exile.

00:58:54.520 --> 00:58:57.950
King revises bribery law

00:58:58.690 --> 00:58:59.860
so he

00:58:59.860 --> 00:59:02.990
crossed the path of the Kim clan.

00:59:03.660 --> 00:59:06.860
They are not the kind of people
who will sit idly by.

00:59:12.500 --> 00:59:13.540
Fortunately,

00:59:13.540 --> 00:59:16.170
luck was on the king's side,

00:59:16.170 --> 00:59:19.880
and he found evidence against everyone who was behind these outrages.

00:59:27.080 --> 00:59:30.550
After the death of the king

00:59:31.150 --> 00:59:33.460
His food taster also disappeared.

00:59:33.520 --> 00:59:35.590
I'm sure he was poisoned.

00:59:36.660 --> 00:59:38.400
If only we were faster

00:59:38.400 --> 00:59:41.000
the king would still be alive.

00:59:42.430 --> 00:59:46.140
Listen to me
It's not over for you yet

00:59:46.140 --> 00:59:49.370
but if you miss the moment, you won’t get anything back.

00:59:50.040 --> 00:59:52.840
This time it was your maid Ovol who suffered,

00:59:52.980 --> 00:59:56.080
but next time you will be in her place.

00:59:57.180 --> 00:59:59.350
I'll file a petition

01:00:00.150 --> 01:00:02.490
about depriving the queen of her title.

01:00:03.520 --> 01:00:05.820
You don't even have to do anything

01:00:05.890 --> 01:00:08.790
the king will come to meet us.

01:00:08.790 --> 01:00:12.200
You will only have to approve this idea.

01:00:17.530 --> 01:00:21.200
Queen Mother, please forgive me,

01:00:24.210 --> 01:00:27.380
but I need your help.

01:00:30.210 --> 01:00:34.680
All you have to do is take care of our king.

01:00:35.490 --> 01:00:39.820
After this the king will change
his attitude towards the queen,

01:00:39.820 --> 01:00:42.590
won't see why she's doing all this.

01:00:47.060 --> 01:00:51.030
It's cloudy outside.
It looks like it's going to rain.

01:00:51.030 --> 01:00:52.540
Court lady Han,

01:00:52.970 --> 01:00:55.710
The room is dark, light the candles.

01:00:55.810 --> 01:00:57.240
I obey.

01:01:24.170 --> 01:01:26.900
If you wait for the king, he won't come.

01:01:27.400 --> 01:01:29.340
How do you know that...

01:01:29.540 --> 01:01:32.710
You'll just calm down
when will you take everything from me?

01:01:32.940 --> 01:01:35.410
Have you changed the letter?

01:01:37.410 --> 01:01:39.520
You changed something more serious.

01:01:39.780 --> 01:01:41.950
Why can't I replace such a small thing?

01:01:45.190 --> 01:01:47.160
I don't understand what you're talking about.

01:01:48.590 --> 01:01:52.260
I know you lied.

01:01:56.330 --> 01:01:59.070
If the king finds out the truth,

01:02:00.300 --> 01:02:02.910
then you will understand my feelings.

01:02:03.770 --> 01:02:06.940
The feeling you get
when you lose someone you care about.

01:02:07.010 --> 01:02:08.480
How hard is it for you

01:02:09.610 --> 01:02:12.420
will look into his eyes

01:02:13.550 --> 01:02:15.750
for the rest of my life.

01:02:23.060 --> 01:02:26.930
If you want to keep everything a secret, leave the palace.

01:02:28.800 --> 01:02:31.130
You found my weak spot.

01:02:31.500 --> 01:02:34.740
Okay, tell this to the king,

01:02:34.940 --> 01:02:38.470
but then you will have to talk about something else.

01:02:40.210 --> 01:02:41.740
Have you tried

01:02:42.610 --> 01:02:44.580
kill the king.

01:02:53.460 --> 01:02:55.730
So you know.

01:02:56.990 --> 01:02:58.530
You have

01:02:59.630 --> 01:03:01.630
nothing will come of it.

01:03:07.040 --> 01:03:08.770
Someday you too will lose

01:03:09.770 --> 01:03:12.610
person dear to you.

01:03:52.920 --> 01:03:54.450
What's happened?

01:03:56.990 --> 01:03:59.090
You already know.

01:03:59.720 --> 01:04:01.220
His Majesty

01:04:02.060 --> 01:04:04.390
weak when he feels guilty.

01:04:06.060 --> 01:04:08.000
This is the price of survival.

01:04:08.630 --> 01:04:10.300
Guilt.

01:04:16.510 --> 01:04:20.740
Your Majesty, this is what you are willing to do,
to win the favor of the king?

01:04:36.890 --> 01:04:39.300
Hurry up, clean it up before everything gets wet!

01:04:39.300 --> 01:04:40.960
Hurry up!

01:04:44.970 --> 01:04:48.140
It had been raining for several days now.

01:04:48.270 --> 01:04:50.270
And finally he went.

01:04:51.470 --> 01:04:54.440
In this life my position is higher than in the present one,

01:04:54.950 --> 01:04:57.680
but why do I feel even worse?

01:04:57.680 --> 01:04:58.680
Your Majesty,

01:04:58.680 --> 01:05:03.020
Do you think I can have another life?

01:05:03.920 --> 01:05:07.390
According to the theory of parallel worlds, everything is possible.

01:05:11.900 --> 01:05:12.900
Look.

01:05:12.900 --> 01:05:15.630
This is the life you are living now.

01:05:16.630 --> 01:05:19.200
But this is your other life.
Understand?

01:05:19.540 --> 01:05:21.470
Some kind of damn thing.

01:05:23.340 --> 01:05:25.340
After I started talking

01:05:25.340 --> 01:05:28.110
with the queen, spoke some gibberish.

01:05:28.710 --> 01:05:33.580
Then could this puppy
to be human in a past life?

01:05:34.180 --> 01:05:35.790
Anything is possible.

01:05:35.990 --> 01:05:37.920
And the cook is a fool?

01:05:41.420 --> 01:05:44.690
Otherwise... He was probably my subordinate.

01:05:45.500 --> 01:05:47.360
What about me?

01:05:48.770 --> 01:05:53.040
You will always be Choi's court lady.

01:05:53.900 --> 01:05:56.010
And you, Hongyong...

01:05:56.010 --> 01:05:58.740
Then my mom and dad

01:05:58.740 --> 01:06:01.080
will they be happy in their next life?

01:06:01.080 --> 01:06:02.080
What?

01:06:02.080 --> 01:06:05.620
My mother only has four nails left.

01:06:05.620 --> 01:06:09.090
She lost her nails
when I was sorting through stones in the cold winter.

01:06:09.090 --> 01:06:14.020
In another life with my mother
will all the nails be in place?

01:06:14.890 --> 01:06:17.430
Certainly.

01:06:17.430 --> 01:06:19.760
And the priest will have two eyes!

01:06:19.760 --> 01:06:21.360
What about your father?

01:06:21.360 --> 01:06:24.030
-They gouged out his eye with a pitchfork.
-What?

01:06:24.030 --> 01:06:25.840
Must have borrowed rice

01:06:25.840 --> 01:06:28.000
and did not pay interest.

01:06:28.070 --> 01:06:31.010
And the moneylenders then collect the debts.

01:06:31.840 --> 01:06:35.010
In every yard there is someone
victimized by moneylenders.

01:06:36.580 --> 01:06:37.810
Don't worry.

01:06:37.810 --> 01:06:40.720
In your next life with your mother
there will be beautiful healthy nails,

01:06:40.720 --> 01:06:42.250
You won't even need a manicure.

01:06:42.250 --> 01:06:43.750
And father will have

01:06:43.750 --> 01:06:47.120
His eyes are so sparkling, it’s like he’s wearing contacts.

01:06:47.890 --> 01:06:52.600
I would like to see my mother with healthy nails.

01:06:52.930 --> 01:06:54.430
Eh!

01:06:56.100 --> 01:06:57.530
And I.

01:06:58.300 --> 01:07:00.400
I really want to see my mother.

01:07:02.140 --> 01:07:06.210
You didn't get to see your mother's face!

01:07:06.310 --> 01:07:07.740
How so.

01:07:08.480 --> 01:07:11.080
Well, why did you remember about her?

01:07:11.980 --> 01:07:14.320
I'm not talking about this mom!

01:07:14.320 --> 01:07:17.420
I'm talking about Ms. Li Sunxin, she is alive and well!

01:07:18.620 --> 01:07:20.560
He even does Zumba!

01:07:20.560 --> 01:07:22.390
Why do you make me feel like an orphan?

01:07:27.930 --> 01:07:29.770
Gathered in the royal kitchen,

01:07:29.770 --> 01:07:32.100
where the path is closed to women, and they whine.

01:07:32.100 --> 01:07:34.800
I don't understand women.

01:07:38.780 --> 01:07:40.240
Mommy?

01:07:42.450 --> 01:07:43.880
Mommy!

01:07:57.890 --> 01:08:00.330
It's raining, so everyone is sad.

01:08:01.200 --> 01:08:04.000
Listen, bring me some pajeon and makgeolli.

01:08:05.270 --> 01:08:06.670
Return to Daejojeon Hall.

01:08:06.670 --> 01:08:08.870
The rain will continue to fall for a long time.

01:08:10.270 --> 01:08:11.510
How do you know?

01:08:11.510 --> 01:08:13.910
Have you become a meteorological computer?

01:08:13.910 --> 01:08:16.480
I have no idea what you're talking about

01:08:16.610 --> 01:08:19.050
but my wrist hurts a lot,

01:08:19.050 --> 01:08:21.620
This means it will rain all night.

01:08:23.820 --> 01:08:25.450
How strong?

01:08:25.860 --> 01:08:27.960
I don't know

01:08:29.730 --> 01:08:32.900
when it hurts so much, it means

01:08:32.900 --> 01:08:36.470
All barrels will be filled in just a couple of hours.

01:08:37.270 --> 01:08:39.540
Will it fill the barrels in a couple of hours?

01:08:39.800 --> 01:08:43.540
Then will there be water in lakes and wells?

01:08:56.550 --> 01:08:58.020
Chief Eunuch.

01:08:58.820 --> 01:09:00.360
I'm listening, sir.

01:09:03.330 --> 01:09:04.430
Book of Changes

01:09:04.430 --> 01:09:06.800
So that our nights with the queen
were more productive

01:09:06.800 --> 01:09:09.970
I'll go to bed after
I'll read a little more.

01:09:10.100 --> 01:09:12.540
It's late, you can go.

01:09:12.800 --> 01:09:14.240
I obey.

01:09:22.380 --> 01:09:25.250
Notes on weapons and equipment

01:09:53.040 --> 01:09:55.710
I'll come back when you feel better.

01:09:55.710 --> 01:09:59.050
Don't come unless you're ready to beg on your knees.

01:09:59.080 --> 01:10:01.550
She told me not to come!

01:10:11.430 --> 01:10:14.230
Everyday I bend my knees

01:10:15.830 --> 01:10:19.840
but not in front of whom
I should bow down.

01:10:28.950 --> 01:10:30.410
Your Majesty!

01:10:31.110 --> 01:10:32.980
You'll get sick!

01:10:32.980 --> 01:10:34.920
I don’t care about illness!

01:10:34.920 --> 01:10:37.020
Look, heaven is on my side!

01:10:37.020 --> 01:10:39.620
My God, madam, stop it!

01:10:40.090 --> 01:10:42.730
Please, calm down!

01:11:13.890 --> 01:11:15.630
Your Majesty!

01:11:15.630 --> 01:11:16.860
Your Majesty?

01:11:16.860 --> 01:11:19.260
And one more time!

01:11:19.260 --> 01:11:20.830
What are you talking about?

01:11:20.830 --> 01:11:22.830
Like this! Hooray! Finally!

01:11:22.830 --> 01:11:24.330
Your Majesty!

01:11:24.330 --> 01:11:26.700
What's the matter with you?

01:11:33.040 --> 01:11:35.140
What kind of woman is she?

01:11:35.710 --> 01:11:37.910
You never know what's on her mind.

01:11:37.910 --> 01:11:40.450
Like this! Wonderful!

01:11:40.520 --> 01:11:43.220
What happened to you?

01:11:45.250 --> 01:11:48.160
Why are you without a support group?

01:11:57.070 --> 01:11:59.300
Also decided to take a walk in the rain?

01:12:00.470 --> 01:12:03.040
I came to apologize.

01:12:04.440 --> 01:12:06.310
Forget it, I don't care.

01:12:06.310 --> 01:12:07.740
No,

01:12:07.740 --> 01:12:09.910
I can't forget about it.

01:12:09.910 --> 01:12:12.520
I’m telling you, I don’t care, why are you attached?

01:12:13.080 --> 01:12:14.480
Got attached?

01:12:16.820 --> 01:12:19.020
I'm a simple person.

01:12:19.020 --> 01:12:20.560
I'm glad to see you - I'm swearing,

01:12:20.560 --> 01:12:22.890
I'm grateful - I'm getting into a fight.

01:12:22.890 --> 01:12:24.890
I can't stand sycophants

01:12:25.060 --> 01:12:26.500
get out.

01:12:30.700 --> 01:12:32.200
Leave?

01:12:32.300 --> 01:12:34.270
I mustered up the courage to apologize

01:12:34.270 --> 01:12:36.640
and this is what I get in response?

01:12:36.670 --> 01:12:39.380
Listen, if the only person who needs an apology is

01:12:39.380 --> 01:12:42.510
who apologizes, not the one who
who receives them, is this an apology?

01:12:45.980 --> 01:12:48.990
The royal family has its own rules.

01:12:48.990 --> 01:12:52.050
How long are you going to talk so strangely?

01:12:53.160 --> 01:12:55.720
Only today. This is the last day.

01:12:55.730 --> 01:13:00.060
And tomorrow everything will fall into place!

01:13:00.060 --> 01:13:02.830
Like this! Oh yes!

01:13:02.830 --> 01:13:04.670
Your Majesty!

01:13:04.670 --> 01:13:06.870
-Like this!
-Queen!

01:13:06.870 --> 01:13:08.940
Oh yes!

01:13:10.410 --> 01:13:13.640
Your Majesty, come to your senses!

01:13:13.640 --> 01:13:15.280
Oh yes!

01:13:18.080 --> 01:13:21.380
You offended me, so today we sleep separately.

01:13:24.120 --> 01:13:25.650
Spend the night alone.

01:13:27.760 --> 01:13:31.360
God bless! I'm so glad to hear this!

01:13:33.430 --> 01:13:35.330
What a great guy I am.

01:13:41.170 --> 01:13:42.940
Did you go outside without an umbrella?

01:13:42.940 --> 01:13:45.770
Sometimes I like to take a walk without an umbrella.

01:13:45.840 --> 01:13:49.510
I feel like the rain is washing away all my worries.

01:13:52.150 --> 01:13:54.250
Don't be sad!

01:13:54.250 --> 01:13:56.120
Your Majesty, go back inside!

01:13:56.350 --> 01:13:58.990
What a nightmare! Empress!

01:13:58.990 --> 01:14:00.620
Stop it!

01:14:01.460 --> 01:14:04.360
What is this? Why would there be thunder?

01:14:04.360 --> 01:14:06.430
Heaven is angry!

01:14:07.130 --> 01:14:08.630
Get angry!

01:14:08.630 --> 01:14:12.740
I move my pelvis if it means
that the rain will continue to pour for a long time!

01:14:13.340 --> 01:14:16.270
Your Majesty! Stop it!

01:14:16.270 --> 01:14:18.170
Oh yes!

01:14:18.170 --> 01:14:19.680
Please!

01:14:20.080 --> 01:14:21.540
Your Majesty!

01:14:21.540 --> 01:14:23.950
The queen's illness is getting worse day by day,

01:14:23.950 --> 01:14:26.280
she does not miss the chance to commit suicide.

01:14:26.320 --> 01:14:29.390
The whole yard trembles from her antics.

01:14:30.250 --> 01:14:33.690
Wouldn't it be better to file a petition?

01:14:33.690 --> 01:14:35.660
about stripping her of her title?

01:14:35.890 --> 01:14:38.730
-You're right.
-Right.

01:14:38.730 --> 01:14:41.700
It's time for our clan

01:14:41.700 --> 01:14:44.070
gather your strength.

01:14:58.980 --> 01:15:01.480
When the enemy opens his defenseless neck,

01:15:01.950 --> 01:15:04.450
you have to grab onto it right away.

01:15:09.490 --> 01:15:12.190
The core of our country is in danger.

01:15:12.190 --> 01:15:15.860
Stripping the queen of her title is the right decision.

01:15:24.570 --> 01:15:27.410
Once upon a time there lived an immortal named Achilles.

01:15:27.410 --> 01:15:29.510
And he had only one weak point.

01:15:29.510 --> 01:15:32.380
Legends say
that he died from an arrow shot into his heel.

01:15:32.550 --> 01:15:35.480
This is how the expression "Achilles' heel" came about.

01:15:36.420 --> 01:15:37.890
But the real reason for his death is

01:15:37.890 --> 01:15:41.020
that Achilles did not have what
who would make him armored shoes.

01:15:41.020 --> 01:15:42.460
They say...

01:15:42.460 --> 01:15:45.900
If people wanted to get rid
weak points, they would get rid of each other.

01:15:45.900 --> 01:15:48.300
Avoid the threat...

01:15:48.300 --> 01:15:51.870
We are each other's weak points
reasons why we suffer.

01:15:53.940 --> 01:15:57.970
But we also protect and save each other.

01:16:20.230 --> 01:16:21.730
Hongyong,

01:16:22.030 --> 01:16:24.800
be sure to buy land in Gangnam.

01:16:24.800 --> 01:16:27.370
Yes, Your Majesty.

01:16:29.140 --> 01:16:30.670
Lady Choi,

01:16:31.270 --> 01:16:33.380
You've been through a lot because of me.

01:17:02.540 --> 01:17:04.070
Finally.

01:17:09.010 --> 01:17:12.110
Lake Chhundaji

01:17:26.230 --> 01:17:29.470
I shouldn't have gotten here
Jang Bong-hwan

01:17:30.070 --> 01:17:31.770
We need to celebrate somehow.

01:17:55.360 --> 01:17:58.130
Now everything will finally fall into place.

01:20:11.730 --> 01:20:14.000
The Queen is the most unusual and strange person

01:20:14.000 --> 01:20:16.200
of everyone I know.

01:20:16.200 --> 01:20:18.470
It's like she's not from our world.

01:20:18.470 --> 01:20:20.870
Whose soul do you want to evoke?

01:20:20.870 --> 01:20:24.410
This woman has definitely gone crazy.

01:20:24.410 --> 01:20:26.880
The internal crisis is much worse

01:20:26.880 --> 01:20:28.780
external problem. Don't agree?

01:20:28.780 --> 01:20:30.010
Do you want to say that in the country

01:20:30.010 --> 01:20:31.250
Is there a problem that didn't exist before?

01:20:31.250 --> 01:20:32.310
It turns out...

01:20:32.310 --> 01:20:33.820
His Majesty's Interest in the Queen

01:20:33.820 --> 01:20:35.950
will become our weakness.

01:20:35.950 --> 01:20:39.050
Then today is our first day.

01:20:39.050 --> 01:20:40.460
What?
